This folder is the use case of the Energies paper "On the Potential of District-Scale Life Cycle Assessments of Buildings"
by Schildt, Maximilian; Cuypers, Johannes Linus; Shamovich, Maxim; Herzogenrath, Sonja Tamara; Malhotra, Avichal;
van Treeck, Christoph Alban; Frisch, Jérôme; 2023 (https://doi.org/10.3390/en16155639). Functionality can no longer
be guaranteed given multiple updates of both Teco and TEASER+.